    "detailed_description": "<strong>Politics The Game</strong><br><br>It's high time to claw your way to the top!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/578fbbd8d0cbbb1c268dd8e5e9b892f1.poster.avif?t=1751271014\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/578fbbd8d0cbbb1c268dd8e5e9b892f1.webm?t=1751271014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Politics The Game</strong> is the first RPG that lets you become your favorite parliamentarian, create the most powerful party in Poland, and lead it to power!<br><br>However, it won't be easy - you must take care of not only your popularity but also your human dignity. Your character can endure a lot, but if they lose self-respect, they will have to step down!<br><br>Make use of awesome special powers:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Critical attack using a battle cat? Absolutely!<br></li><li>German agent curse that reduces the popularity of the attacked? Of course.<br></li><li>Evacuating units weakened by fights at the festival using a police Black Hawk? You bet!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/421dd11f48469696e75ef1eb23a05f1b.poster.avif?t=1751271014\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/421dd11f48469696e75ef1eb23a05f1b.webm?t=1751271014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 parliamentarians with different stats and special skills<br></li><li>Freedom to create your own political party<br></li><li>Unique humor<br></li><li>A storyline referring to current events in national politics</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/9396d8664a01eea8edc1a72c356e44f8.poster.avif?t=1751271014\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/9396d8664a01eea8edc1a72c356e44f8.webm?t=1751271014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Politics The Game</strong> has a low entry barrier. The rules can be understood even by a moderately bright left-wing MP, but to achieve perfection at the highest difficulty level, you'll need the strategic genius of Jaros\u0142aw himself.<br><br>Add <strong>Politics The Game</strong> to your wishlist so you don't miss the release!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Politics The Game</strong><br><br>It's high time to claw your way to the top!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/578fbbd8d0cbbb1c268dd8e5e9b892f1.poster.avif?t=1751271014\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/578fbbd8d0cbbb1c268dd8e5e9b892f1.webm?t=1751271014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Politics The Game</strong> is the first RPG that lets you become your favorite parliamentarian, create the most powerful party in Poland, and lead it to power!<br><br>However, it won't be easy - you must take care of not only your popularity but also your human dignity. Your character can endure a lot, but if they lose self-respect, they will have to step down!<br><br>Make use of awesome special powers:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Critical attack using a battle cat? Absolutely!<br></li><li>German agent curse that reduces the popularity of the attacked? Of course.<br></li><li>Evacuating units weakened by fights at the festival using a police Black Hawk? You bet!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/421dd11f48469696e75ef1eb23a05f1b.poster.avif?t=1751271014\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/421dd11f48469696e75ef1eb23a05f1b.webm?t=1751271014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 parliamentarians with different stats and special skills<br></li><li>Freedom to create your own political party<br></li><li>Unique humor<br></li><li>A storyline referring to current events in national politics</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/9396d8664a01eea8edc1a72c356e44f8.poster.avif?t=1751271014\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/9396d8664a01eea8edc1a72c356e44f8.webm?t=1751271014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Politics The Game</strong> has a low entry barrier. The rules can be understood even by a moderately bright left-wing MP, but to achieve perfection at the highest difficulty level, you'll need the strategic genius of Jaros\u0142aw himself.<br><br>Add <strong>Politics The Game</strong> to your wishlist so you don't miss the release!",
